+# Plain HTTP for Internal Hosts
+
+The project's current recorded decision is that HTTPS is mandatory across all services, with no plaintext exceptions. This applies to internal hosts as well as external ones, regardless of deployment context or network topology, so plain HTTP is not permitted for internal service-to-service communication.
